 5. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Pay raises and added equity took center stage during Nvidia's first all-hands without Jensen Huang. (Wired) In a review, Bloomberg's Jason Schreier called " Grand Theft Auto VI " "an unparalleled technical and comedic masterpiece." We'll know soon whether the memes predicting bad news dumps during the release will be realized. At the New York Times' DealBook Summit, Elon Musk said he's "not MAGA" and admitted he felt "pretty foolish" after spending nearly half a billion dollars to elect Republicans in the blue wave midterms. (Variety) 
 
